  (text "Revision: rev-a    Date: 2026-10-18    Status: Reworked 4-layer design (62 parts)\nESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 battery voltage monitor, systems up to 24 V,\nWi-Fi reports, Ra-02 433 MHz LoRa fitted (as rev-c).\n01-power: inlet protection, LMR38010SDDAR 3.3 V buck\n02-mcu-usb: native USB-C, buttons/UART removed   04-lora: inherited from rev-c\n03-sense: always-on 0.1 % divider, ADS1115 (I2C 0x48)\n05-io: external button JST-XH 2P (J504), status/alert LEDs, I2C pull-ups, LED voltmeter JST-XH 3P (J503)\nDesign record: evidence/rework-20261018/step1-sch/CHANGES.md"
    (at 25.4 166.37 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "ce20ed31-8013-4940-992a-c9f69d119db4")
  )
)
